@startuml
title UC - Handle Invalid Credentials

start

:1. Enter email and password;
:2. Submit login request;
:3. System validates credentials;

if (4. Credentials valid?) then (No)
  :5. Display "Email or Password Incorrect" message;
else (Yes)
  :6. Redirect to dashboard;
endif

stop

note right
Activity Description:

1. User enters their email and password.
2. User submits the login request.
3. System validates the entered credentials.
4. System checks whether the credentials are valid.
5. If invalid, the system displays a message indicating the email or password is incorrect.
6. If valid, the system redirects the user to their dashboard.
end note

@enduml